+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>What this graph shows:</strong> Histogram of 1000 exam scores drawn from Normal(72, 12). The gold curve is the theoretical normal PDF. The red dashed line marks the mean, and purple dotted lines mark \u00b11 standard deviation (68% of data falls between them). This is the foundation of Gaussian distributions used throughout ML.</div></div>'

