+ 'Plotly.newPlot("plot-hist-tr",[t1,t2],layout,{responsive:true,displayModeBar:false});'
+ '},200)</script>'

+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> Normal(72, 12) da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131ndan \u00e7ekilen 1000 s\u0131nav puan\u0131n\u0131n histogramn. Alt\u0131n rengi e\u011fri teorik normal PDF\'dir. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kesikli \u00e7izgi ortalamay\u0131, mor noktal\u0131 \u00e7izgiler \u00b11 standart sapmay\u0131 g\u00f6sterir (verinin %68\'i aralar\u0131nda kal\u0131r). Bu, ML boyunca kullan\u0131lan Gaussian da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131n temelidir.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">ML BA\u011eLANTISI</div><div class="example-body"><strong>Batch normalization</strong>, derin \u00f6\u011frenmede bir mini-batch boyunca \u00f6znitelik ba\u015f\u0131na ortalama ve varyans hesaplar, sonra normalize eder: <code>x_hat = (x - ortalama) / sqrt(var + eps)</code>. Bu tam olarak NumPy\'nin <code>np.mean()</code> ve <code>np.var()</code> fonksiyonlar\u0131n\u0131n <code>axis=0</code> ile yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u015feydir.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 2: Korelasyon ve Kovaryans
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">2. Korelasyon ve Kovaryans</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Korelasyon ve kovaryans</strong>, iki de\u011fi\u015fkenin birlikte nas\u0131l hareket etti\u011fini \u00f6l\u00e7er. ML\'de \u00f6znitelik se\u00e7imi (y\u00fcksek korelasyonlu \u00f6znitelikleri \u00e7\u0131karma), de\u011fi\u015fkenler aras\u0131ndaki ili\u015fkileri anlama ve do\u011frusal modellerde \u00e7oklu ba\u011flant\u0131l\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 tespit etme i\u00e7in kritiktirler.</p>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Kovaryans \u2014 iki de\u011fi\u015fkenin ortak de\u011fi\u015fkenli\u011fi:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$\\text{Cov}(X, Y) = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i - \\mu_X)(y_i - \\mu_Y)$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Cov(X,Y)</div><div class="card-body">Kovaryans \u2014 X ve Y birlikte nas\u0131l de\u011fi\u015fti\u011fini \u00f6l\u00e7er. Pozitif: ayn\u0131 y\u00f6ne hareket. Negatif: z\u0131t y\u00f6ne hareket. S\u0131f\u0131r: do\u011frusal ili\u015fki yok.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03bc_X, \u03bc_Y</div><div class="card-body">X ve Y\'nin ortalamalar\u0131. \u00c7arpmadan \u00f6nce her de\u011fi\u015fken kendi ortalamas\u0131yla merkezlenir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">(x_i\u2212\u03bc_X)(y_i\u2212\u03bc_Y)</div><div class="card-body">E\u015fli sapmalar\u0131n \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131. \u0130ki sapma da ayn\u0131 i\u015faretliyse \u00e7arp\u0131m pozitiftir; bu kovaryans\u0131 yukar\u0131 \u00e7eker.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u00d6l\u00e7e\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131</div><div class="card-body">Kovaryans\u0131n b\u00fcy\u00fckl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc X ve Y birimine ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r. Bu y\u00fczden farkl\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fken \u00e7iftlerini do\u011frudan k\u0131yaslamak zor \u2014 korelasyon bu y\u00fczden vard\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Pearson korelasyonu \u2014 kovaryans\u0131n \u00f6l\u00e7eksiz hali:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$\\rho_{XY} = \\frac{\\text{Cov}(X, Y)}{\\sigma_X \\, \\sigma_Y}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03c1 (rho)</div><div class="card-body">Pearson korelasyon katsay\u0131s\u0131 \u2014 \u22121 ile +1 aras\u0131nda s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131d\u0131r. \u0130ki de\u011fi\u015fken aras\u0131ndaki do\u011frusal ili\u015fkinin standart \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcs\u00fc.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03c3_X \u00b7 \u03c3_Y</div><div class="card-body">Standart sapmalar\u0131n \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131 \u2014 kovaryans\u0131 birimsiz hale getirir. Bu y\u00fczden korelasyon farkl\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fken \u00e7iftleri aras\u0131nda k\u0131yaslanabilir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03c1 = +1</div><div class="card-body">Kusursuz pozitif do\u011frusal ili\u015fki. X artt\u0131k\u00e7a Y de d\u00fcz bir do\u011fru \u00fczerinde orant\u0131l\u0131 olarak artar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03c1 = \u22121</div><div class="card-body">Kusursuz negatif do\u011frusal ili\u015fki. X artt\u0131k\u00e7a Y d\u00fcz bir do\u011fru \u00fczerinde orant\u0131l\u0131 olarak azal\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03c1 \u2248 0</div><div class="card-body">DO\u011eRUSAL ili\u015fki yok. Dikkat: Y = X\u00b2 gibi g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc bir do\u011frusal-olmayan ili\u015fki bile \u03c1 \u2248 0 verebilir!</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Kovaryans</div><div class="card-body">np.cov(x, y) \u2014 ortak de\u011fi\u015fkenli\u011fi \u00f6l\u00e7er. Pozitif = birlikte hareket, negatif = z\u0131t y\u00f6nde. B\u00fcy\u00fckl\u00fck \u00f6l\u00e7e\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Korelasyon</div><div class="card-body">np.corrcoef(x, y) \u2014 normalize kovaryans, her zaman -1 ile +1 aras\u0131nda. \u00d6l\u00e7ekten ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z. Do\u011frusal ili\u015fkinin standart \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcs\u00fc.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Korelasyon Yok</div><div class="card-body">r \u2248 0, DO\u011eRUSAL ili\u015fki olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 anlam\u0131na gelir (do\u011frusal olmayan bir ili\u015fki olabilir). Ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131zl\u0131kla kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmay\u0131n!</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">M\u00fckemmel Korelasyon</div><div class="card-body">r = +1 m\u00fckemmel pozitif do\u011frusal ili\u015fki. r = -1 m\u00fckemmel negatif. Ger\u00e7ek veride nadiren g\u00f6r\u00fcl\u00fcr.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nnp.random.<span class="fn">seed</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Korelasyonlu \u00f6znitelikler sim\u00fcle et</span>\nboy = np.random.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">170</span>, <span class="num">10</span>, <span class="num">200</span>)            <span class="cm"># cm</span>\nkilo = <span class="num">0.8</span> * boy + np.random.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">8</span>, <span class="num">200</span>)  <span class="cm"># boy ile korelasyonlu</span>\nayak = np.random.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">42</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">200</span>)            <span class="cm"># zay\u0131f korelasyon</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Korelasyon katsay\u0131s\u0131 matrisi</span>\ncorr = np.<span class="fn">corrcoef</span>([boy, kilo, ayak])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Korelasyon matrisi:"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(np.<span class="fn">round</span>(corr, <span class="num">3</span>))\n<span class="cm"># [[1.    0.78  0.03]</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [0.78  1.    0.02]</span>\n<span class="cm">#  [0.03  0.02  1.   ]]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u0130kili korelasyonu \u00e7\u0131kar</span>\nr_bk = np.<span class="fn">corrcoef</span>(boy, kilo)[<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"\\nBoy-Kilo korelasyonu: {r_bk:.3f}"</span>)  <span class="cm"># ~0.78</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">KOVARYANS</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">B\u00fcy\u00fckl\u00fck de\u011fi\u015fken \u00f6l\u00e7eklerine ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Birimler: de\u011fi\u015fken birimlerinin \u00e7arp\u0131m\u0131</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Aral\u0131k: (-\u221e, +\u221e)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">De\u011fi\u015fkenler aras\u0131 yorumlanmas\u0131 zor</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">PCA, Mahalanobis uzakl\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kullan\u0131l\u0131r</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">KORELASYON</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u00d6l\u00e7ekten ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z (normalize)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Birimsiz</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Aral\u0131k: [-1, +1]</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Yorumlamas\u0131 kolay: \u00b11\'e yak\u0131n = g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u00d6znitelik se\u00e7imi, EDA\'da kullan\u0131l\u0131r</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

/* --- Plotly: Korelasyon Scatter (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-corr-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var n=150;var hx=[];var wy=[];var sx=[];var sy=[];'
+ 'for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var h=150+Math.random()*40;hx.push(h);wy.push(0.8*h+((Math.random()-0.5)*20));sx.push(h);sy.push(35+Math.random()*14);}'
+ 'var t1={x:hx,y:wy,mode:"markers",name:"Boy vs Kilo (r\u22480.78)",marker:{color:"#4ecdc4",size:5,opacity:0.7}};'
+ 'var t2={x:sx,y:sy,mode:"markers",name:"Boy vs Ayak No (r\u22480.03)",marker:{color:"#a78bfa",size:5,opacity:0.7},xaxis:"x2",yaxis:"y2"};'
+ 'var xfit=[150,190];var yfit=[0.8*150,0.8*190];'
+ 'var t3={x:xfit,y:yfit,mode:"lines",name:"Trend",line:{color:"#f87171",width:2,dash:"dash"},showlegend:false};'
+ 'var layout={title:{text:"Korelasyon: G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc (sol) vs Yok (sa\u011f)",font:{color:"#ebe6dc",size:14}},paper_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",plot_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",font:{color:"#ebe6dc"},grid:{rows:1,columns:2,pattern:"independent"},xaxis:{title:"Boy (cm)",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)",domain:[0,0.45]},yaxis:{title:"Kilo (kg)",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"},xaxis2:{title:"Boy (cm)",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)",domain:[0.55,1]},yaxis2:{title:"Ayak No",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)",anchor:"x2"},margin:{t:50,r:30,b:60,l:60},legend:{font:{color:"#ebe6dc"},x:0.02,y:0.98},showlegend:true};'
+ 'Plotly.newPlot("plot-corr-tr",[t1,t3,t2],layout,{responsive:true,displayModeBar:false});'
+ '},200)</script>'

+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> Sol panel: boy-kilo aras\u0131nda g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc pozitif korelasyon (r \u2248 0.78) \u2014 noktalar trend \u00e7izgisi etraf\u0131nda s\u0131k\u0131 k\u00fcmeleniyor. Sa\u011f panel: boy-ayak numaras\u0131 aras\u0131nda korelasyon yok (r \u2248 0.03) \u2014 noktalar rastgele da\u011f\u0131lm\u0131\u015f. ML\'de g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc korelasyonlu \u00f6znitelikler ger\u00e7eksiz bilgi ta\u015f\u0131r ve biri genellikle \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131labilir.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>\u00d6znitelik se\u00e7imi ipucu:</strong> Do\u011frusal modeller olu\u015ftururken \u00f6nce korelasyon matrisini kontrol edin. \u0130ki \u00f6znitelik |r| > 0.9 ise, neredeyse do\u011frusal ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131d\u0131r \u2014 birini \u00e7\u0131karmay\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn. Y\u00fcksek \u00e7oklu ba\u011fl\u0131l\u0131k katsay\u0131 varyans\u0131n\u0131 \u015fi\u015firir ve modeli dengesiz yapar. <code>np.corrcoef(X.T)</code> kullan\u0131n; X\'in boyutu (n_ornekler, n_oznitelikler) olmal\u0131d\u0131r.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 3: S\u0131ralama ve Arama
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">3. S\u0131ralama ve Arama</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>ML\'de s\u0131ralama neden \u00f6nemli:</strong> En iyi k tahmin, \u00f6znitelikleri \u00f6neme g\u00f6re s\u0131ralama, y\u00fczdelik hesaplama, karar a\u011fa\u00e7lar\u0131 olu\u015fturma (her b\u00f6l\u00fcmde \u00f6znitelikleri s\u0131ralar) ve verimli en yak\u0131n kom\u015fu arama hepsi s\u0131ralamaya ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r. NumPy\'nin s\u0131ralama fonksiyonlar\u0131 O(n log n) derlenmi\u015f C\'de \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text">NumPy, farkl\u0131 kullan\u0131m durumlar\u0131 i\u00e7in optimize edilmi\u015f \u00e7e\u015fitli s\u0131ralama ve arama fonksiyonlar\u0131 sunar:</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.sort</div><div class="card-body">Dizinin s\u0131ralanm\u0131\u015f bir kopyas\u0131n\u0131 d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Orijinali de\u011fi\u015ftirmez. Varsay\u0131lan olarak introsort ile O(n log n).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.argsort</div><div class="card-body">Diziyi s\u0131ralayacak indeksleri d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Bir diziyi ba\u015fka birine g\u00f6re s\u0131ralamak i\u00e7in gerekli (orn. isimleri puanlara g\u00f6re s\u0131rala).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.partition</div><div class="card-body">K\u0131smi s\u0131ralar: k\'nc\u0131 en k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck eleman k konumunda, k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fckler \u00f6nce, b\u00fcy\u00fckler sonra. O(n) \u2014 top-k i\u00e7in tam s\u0131ralamadan \u00e7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131!</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.lexsort</div><div class="card-body">\u00c7oklu anahtara g\u00f6re s\u0131ralar (SQL ORDER BY gibi). Son anahtar birincil s\u0131ralama anahtar\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># Temel s\u0131ralama</span>\narr = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">42</span>, <span class="num">15</span>, <span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">67</span>, <span class="num">29</span>])\nsorted_arr = np.<span class="fn">sort</span>(arr)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"S\u0131ral\u0131:"</span>, sorted_arr)         <span class="cm"># [ 3 15 29 42 67 88]</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Orijinal:"</span>, arr)              <span class="cm"># [42 15 88  3 67 29] \u2014 de\u011fi\u015fmedi!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Yerinde s\u0131ralama (diziyi de\u011fi\u015ftirir)</span>\narr.<span class="fn">sort</span>()\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">".sort() sonras\u0131:"</span>, arr)      <span class="cm"># [ 3 15 29 42 67 88]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Azalan s\u0131ra (ters dilimleme ile)</span>\narr_desc = np.<span class="fn">sort</span>(arr)[::-<span class="num">1</span>]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Azalan:"</span>, arr_desc)           <span class="cm"># [88 67 42 29 15  3]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># argsort \u2014 s\u0131ralama indekslerini d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr</span>\npuanlar = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">85</span>, <span class="num">92</span>, <span class="num">78</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">88</span>])\nisimler = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="str">"Ali"</span>, <span class="str">"Berk"</span>, <span class="str">"Canan"</span>, <span class="str">"Defne"</span>, <span class="str">"Elif"</span>])\nsira = np.<span class="fn">argsort</span>(puanlar)[::-<span class="num">1</span>]    <span class="cm"># azalan puan indeksleri</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"S\u0131ralama:"</span>, isimler[sira])    <span class="cm"># [Defne Berk Elif Ali Canan]</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Puanlar: "</span>, puanlar[sira])     <span class="cm"># [95 92 88 85 78]</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">np.sort(a) vs a.sort()</div><div class="step-detail"><code>np.sort(a)</code> yeni s\u0131ral\u0131 dizi d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr (orijinal de\u011fi\u015fmez). <code>a.sort()</code> yerinde s\u0131ralar (orijinali de\u011fi\u015ftirir, None d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr). ML hatlar\u0131nda yan etkilerden ka\u00e7\u0131nmak i\u00e7in <code>np.sort()</code> tercih edin.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">2B S\u0131ralama ve axis</div><div class="step-detail"><code>np.sort(matris, axis=0)</code> her s\u00fctunu ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z olarak s\u0131ralar. <code>axis=1</code> her sat\u0131r\u0131 s\u0131ralar. <code>axis=-1</code> (varsay\u0131lan) son eksen boyunca s\u0131ralar. <code>axis=None</code> d\u00fczle\u015ftirip t\u00fcm elemanlar\u0131 s\u0131ralar.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Kararl\u0131 vs Karas\u0131z S\u0131ralama</div><div class="step-detail"><code>np.sort(a, kind="stable")</code> e\u015fit elemanlar\u0131n g\u00f6reli s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 korur (mergesort). Varsay\u0131lan <code>kind="quicksort"</code> (asl\u0131nda introsort) daha h\u0131zl\u0131 ama karas\u0131zd\u0131r. E\u015fitliklerde belirleyici s\u0131ra gerekti\u011finde kararl\u0131 kullan\u0131n.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">np.partition ile Top-k</div><div class="step-detail"><code>np.partition(a, k)</code> O(n)\'de \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r \u2014 sadece en k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck/b\u00fcy\u00fck k elemana ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z oldu\u011funda O(n log n) tam s\u0131ralamadan \u00e7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r. 10.000 s\u0131n\u0131ftan en iyi 5 tahmin i\u00e7in tam s\u0131ralamadan 10x daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># --- Partition: O(n) top-k se\u00e7imi ---</span>\ntahminler = np.random.<span class="fn">rand</span>(<span class="num">10000</span>)  <span class="cm"># model \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131 olas\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># En y\u00fcksek 5 tahmin (tam s\u0131ralama olmadan!)</span>\nk = <span class="num">5</span>\ntop_k_idx = np.<span class="fn">argpartition</span>(tahminler, -k)[-k:]\ntop_k_idx = top_k_idx[np.<span class="fn">argsort</span>(tahminler[top_k_idx])[::-<span class="num">1</span>]]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Top-5 indeks:"</span>, top_k_idx)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Top-5 de\u011fer:"</span>, tahminler[top_k_idx])\n\n<span class="cm"># --- lexsort: \u00e7oklu anahtar s\u0131ralama ---</span>\nnotlar = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">3</span>])\nisim_idx = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">4</span>])\nsira = np.<span class="fn">lexsort</span>((isim_idx, notlar))  <span class="cm"># son anahtar birincil!</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"S\u0131ral\u0131 indeks:"</span>, sira)\n\n<span class="cm"># --- searchsorted: s\u0131ral\u0131 dizide ikili arama ---</span>\nsirali = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">10</span>, <span class="num">20</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">40</span>, <span class="num">50</span>])\nidx = np.<span class="fn">searchsorted</span>(sirali, <span class="num">25</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"25\'i ekle indeks:"</span>, idx)  <span class="cm"># 2 (20 ile 30 aras\u0131)</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">ML UYGULAMASI</div><div class="example-body"><strong>S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmada top-k tahmin:</strong> Bir model 10.000 s\u0131n\u0131f i\u00e7in olas\u0131l\u0131klar \u00fcrettti\u011finde (orn. ImageNet), t\u00fcm s\u0131n\u0131flar\u0131n s\u0131ral\u0131 olmas\u0131na nadiren ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z vard\u0131r. <code>np.argpartition(probs, -5)[-5:]</code> size O(n log n) yerine O(n)\'de en iyi 5 tahmini verir. Ger\u00e7ek zamanl\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131mda bu fark \u00f6nemlidir. Ayn\u0131 teknik, uzakl\u0131k matrisinde k-en yak\u0131n kom\u015fu bulmak i\u00e7in de ge\u00e7erlidir.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 4: K\u00fcme \u0130\u015flemleri
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">4. K\u00fcme \u0130\u015flemleri</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">NumPy diziler \u00fczerinde h\u0131zl\u0131 k\u00fcme i\u015flemleri sunar \u2014 benzersiz de\u011ferler bulma, kesi\u015fimler, birle\u015fimler ve farklar. Veri temizleme, NLP\'de s\u00f6zl\u00fck olu\u015fturma ve veri k\u00fcmelerini kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rma i\u00e7in gereklidir.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.unique</div><div class="card-body">S\u0131ral\u0131 benzersiz elemanlar\u0131 d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. return_counts=True ile say\u0131mlar\u0131 da verir \u2014 diziler i\u00e7in en h\u0131zl\u0131 value_counts.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.intersect1d</div><div class="card-body">Her iki dizide de ortak elemanlar. \u0130ki derlem aras\u0131nda payla\u015f\u0131lan s\u00f6zc\u00fckleri bulmak i\u00e7in kullan\u0131\u015fl\u0131.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.union1d</div><div class="card-body">Her iki diziden t\u00fcm benzersiz elemanlar birle\u015ftirilmi\u015f. Birle\u015ftirilmi\u015f s\u00f6zl\u00fck olu\u015fturma.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.setdiff1d</div><div class="card-body">A dizisinde olup B dizisinde OLMAYAN elemanlar. Bir belgeye \u00f6zg\u00fc kelimeleri bulma.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># np.unique \u2014 benzersiz de\u011ferleri ve say\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 bul</span>\netiketler = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">2</span>])\nbenzersiz, sayimlar = np.<span class="fn">unique</span>(etiketler, return_counts=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"S\u0131n\u0131flar:"</span>, benzersiz)  <span class="cm"># [0 1 2]</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Say\u0131mlar:"</span>, sayimlar)  <span class="cm"># [3 3 4]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># K\u00fcme i\u015flemleri</span>\ntrain_ids = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">5</span>, <span class="num">8</span>, <span class="num">13</span>])\ntest_ids  = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">7</span>, <span class="num">11</span>, <span class="num">13</span>])\n\n<span class="cm"># Kesi\u015fim: her iki k\u00fcmede bulunan ID\'ler (veri s\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 kontrolu!)</span>\nortak = np.<span class="fn">intersect1d</span>(train_ids, test_ids)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Ortak ID\'ler:"</span>, ortak)  <span class="cm"># [ 2  3 13] \u2190 veri s\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Birle\u015fim: t\u00fcm benzersiz ID\'ler</span>\ntum_ids = np.<span class="fn">union1d</span>(train_ids, test_ids)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"T\u00fcm ID\'ler:"</span>, tum_ids)\n\n<span class="cm"># Fark: yaln\u0131zca train\'de olanlar</span>\nsadece_train = np.<span class="fn">setdiff1d</span>(train_ids, test_ids)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Sadece train:"</span>, sadece_train)  <span class="cm"># [1 5 8]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00dcyelik testi: hangi train_ids test\'te?</span>\nmask = np.<span class="fn">isin</span>(train_ids, test_ids)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Test\'te mi?:"</span>, mask)  <span class="cm"># [False True True False False True]</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">NLP UYGULAMASI</div><div class="example-body"><strong>S\u00f6zl\u00fck i\u015flemleri:</strong> NLP\'de s\u0131kl\u0131kla veri k\u00fcmeleri aras\u0131nda s\u00f6zl\u00fckleri kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rman\u0131z gerekir. <code>np.intersect1d(sozluk_train, sozluk_test)</code> payla\u015f\u0131lan kelimeleri bulur. <code>np.setdiff1d(sozluk_test, sozluk_train)</code> modelin hi\u00e7 g\u00f6rmedi\u011fi s\u00f6zl\u00fck d\u0131\u015f\u0131 (OOV) kelimeleri bulur \u2014 bunlar genellikle &lt;UNK&gt; token\u0131yla de\u011fi\u015ftirilir. <code>np.unique(tokenlar, return_counts=True)</code> size an\u0131nda kelime frekanslar\u0131n\u0131 verir.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>np.isin vs np.in1d:</strong> <code>np.isin(a, b)</code>, <code>np.in1d(a, b)</code>\'nin modern kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131d\u0131r. Her ikisi de <code>a</code>\'n\u0131n hangi elemanlar\u0131n\u0131n <code>b</code>\'de bulundu\u011funu g\u00f6steren bir boolean maske d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Yeni kodda <code>np.isin()</code> kullan\u0131n \u2014 girdi dizisinin \u015feklini korur.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 5: Histogram ve Gruplama
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">5. Histogram ve Gruplama</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Histogram ve gruplama</strong>, s\u00fcrekli verileri ayr\u0131k kategorilere d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr. Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirmek, \u00f6znitelik m\u00fchendisli\u011fi (s\u00fcrekli \u00f6znitelikleri kategorik hale getirme) ve veri yo\u011funlu\u011funu anlamak i\u00e7in temeldir. NumPy hesaplama arka ucunu sa\u011flar \u2014 Plotly ve Matplotlib g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirmeyi ekler.</p>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Gauss (Normal) olas\u0131l\u0131k yo\u011funluk fonksiyonu \u2014 istatisti\u011fin en \u00f6nemli s\u00fcrekli da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$f(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi}} \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">f(x)</div><div class="card-body">x noktas\u0131ndaki olas\u0131l\u0131k yo\u011funlu\u011fu \u2014 \u00e7an e\u011frisinin y\u00fcksekli\u011fi. Not: bu yo\u011funluktur, olas\u0131l\u0131k de\u011fil; yaln\u0131zca aral\u0131k \u00fczerinde integral al\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131nda olas\u0131l\u0131k verir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03bc</div><div class="card-body">Ortalama \u2014 \u00e7an e\u011frisinin merkezi. Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 sa\u011fa veya sola kayd\u0131r\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03c3</div><div class="card-body">Standart sapma \u2014 e\u011frinin geni\u015fli\u011fini kontrol eder. B\u00fcy\u00fck \u03c3 = daha geni\u015f, daha d\u00fcz; k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck \u03c3 = daha dar, daha sivri tepe.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">1/(\u03c3\u221a2\u03c0)</div><div class="card-body">Normalle\u015ftirme sabiti \u2014 e\u011fri alt\u0131ndaki toplam alan\u0131n 1\'e e\u015fit olmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar; b\u00f6ylece f ge\u00e7erli bir olas\u0131l\u0131k yo\u011funlu\u011fu olur.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">exp(\u2212(x\u2212\u03bc)\u00b2/2\u03c3\u00b2)</div><div class="card-body">\u00dcstel azalma terimi. Pay\'daki kareli sapma simetrik \u00e7an \u015feklini verir; 2\u03c3\u00b2\'ye b\u00f6lme azalman\u0131n h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Z-skoru \u2014 bir de\u011ferin ortalamadan ka\u00e7 standart sapma uzakl\u0131kta oldu\u011fu:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$z = \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">z</div><div class="card-body">Z-skoru \u2014 standartla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f de\u011fer. z = 0: x ortalamadad\u0131r; z = 2: x ortalamadan iki standart sapma yukar\u0131dad\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x</div><div class="card-body">Standartla\u015ft\u0131rmak istedi\u011fimiz ham g\u00f6zlem de\u011feri.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">|z| > 3</div><div class="card-body">Yayg\u0131n ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer kural\u0131. Normal da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mda yaln\u0131zca verinin %0.27\'si \u00b13\u03c3 d\u0131\u015f\u0131na d\u00fc\u015fer.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">ML\'de kullan\u0131m</div><div class="card-body">Z-skoru normalizasyonu (StandardScaler) \u00f6znitelikleri s\u0131f\u0131r ortalama, birim varyans yapar \u2014 gradyan tabanl\u0131 modeller i\u00e7in kritik.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.histogram</div><div class="card-body">Grup say\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 ve kenarlar\u0131n\u0131 hesaplar. \u00c7izmez \u2014 (say\u0131mlar, kenarlar) d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Hesaplama i\u00e7in kullan\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.histogram2d</div><div class="card-body">\u0130ki de\u011fi\u015fkenin ortak da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 i\u00e7in 2B histogram. 2B say\u0131m matrisi d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr \u2014 \u0131s\u0131 haritalar\u0131 i\u00e7in m\u00fckemmel.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.digitize</div><div class="card-body">Her de\u011feri bir grup indeksine atar. S\u00fcrekli \u00f6znitelikleri kategorik hale getirmek i\u00e7in gerekli (orn. ya\u015f gruplar\u0131).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">np.bincount</div><div class="card-body">Her negatif olmayan tam say\u0131n\u0131n tekrar\u0131n\u0131 sayar. Tam say\u0131 dizileri i\u00e7in np.unique\'den daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r. Etiket sayma i\u00e7in m\u00fckemmel.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># np.histogram \u2014 histogram hesapla (\u00e7izme!)</span>\ndata = np.random.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">1000</span>)\nsayimlar, kenarlar = np.<span class="fn">histogram</span>(data, bins=<span class="num">20</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Say\u0131mlar:"</span>, sayimlar)           <span class="cm"># 20 say\u0131m\u0131n dizisi</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Kenarlar:"</span>, kenarlar.shape)    <span class="cm"># (21,) \u2014 N grup i\u00e7in N+1 kenar</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00d6zel grup kenarlar\u0131</span>\nyaslar = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">5</span>, <span class="num">12</span>, <span class="num">18</span>, <span class="num">25</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">45</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, <span class="num">15</span>, <span class="num">29</span>])\nbins = [<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">13</span>, <span class="num">18</span>, <span class="num">65</span>, <span class="num">100</span>]   <span class="cm"># \u00e7ocuk, gen\u00e7, yeti\u015fkin, ya\u015fl\u0131</span>\nsayimlar, _ = np.<span class="fn">histogram</span>(yaslar, bins=bins)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Ya\u015f gruplar\u0131:"</span>, sayimlar)     <span class="cm"># [2 2 5 1]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># np.digitize \u2014 grup indeksi ata</span>\ngrup_idx = np.<span class="fn">digitize</span>(yaslar, bins=[<span class="num">13</span>, <span class="num">18</span>, <span class="num">65</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Grup indeksleri:"</span>, grup_idx)\n<span class="cm"># 0=\u00e7ocuk(<13), 1=gen\u00e7(13-18), 2=yeti\u015fkin(18-65), 3=ya\u015fl\u0131(65+)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># np.bincount \u2014 h\u0131zl\u0131 tam say\u0131 sayma</span>\netiketler = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">0</span>])\nsinif_sayilari = np.<span class="fn">bincount</span>(etiketler)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"S\u0131n\u0131f say\u0131lar\u0131:"</span>, sinif_sayilari)  <span class="cm"># [3 3 3]</span></code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: 2B Histogram Is\u0131 Haritas\u0131 (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-hist2d-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var n=500;var x=[];var y=[];'
+ 'for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var x1=((Math.random()+Math.random()+Math.random())-1.5)*2;var y1=0.6*x1+((Math.random()-0.5)*1.5);x.push(x1);y.push(y1);}'
+ 'var t1={x:x,y:y,type:"histogram2d",colorscale:[[0,"rgba(0,0,0,0)"],[0.25,"rgba(78,205,196,0.3)"],[0.5,"rgba(78,205,196,0.6)"],[0.75,"rgba(200,169,110,0.8)"],[1,"#c8a96e"]],nbinsx:25,nbinsy:25,showscale:true,colorbar:{title:"Say\u0131",titlefont:{color:"#ebe6dc"},tickfont:{color:"#ebe6dc"}}};'
+ 'var layout={title:{text:"2B Histogram: \u0130ki Korelasyonlu \u00d6zniteliğin Ortak Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131",font:{color:"#ebe6dc",size:14}},paper_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",plot_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",font:{color:"#ebe6dc"},xaxis:{title:"\u00d6znitelik X",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"},yaxis:{title:"\u00d6znitelik Y",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"},margin:{t:50,r:90,b:50,l:60}};'
+ 'Plotly.newPlot("plot-hist2d-tr",[t1],layout,{responsive:true,displayModeBar:false});'
+ '},200)</script>'

+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> \u0130ki korelasyonlu \u00f6zniteliğin ortak da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6steren 2B histogram (\u0131s\u0131 haritasi). Parlak h\u00fccreler y\u00fcksek yo\u011funlu\u011fu g\u00f6sterir. K\u00f6\u015fegen desen pozitif korelasyonu ortaya \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131r. ML\'de 2B histogramlar, e\u011fitimden \u00f6nce \u00f6znitelik ili\u015fkilerini g\u00f6rselle\u015ftirmeye ve verideki k\u00fcmeleri tespit etmeye yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">\u00d6ZNEL\u0130K M\u00dcHEND\u0130SL\u0130\u011e\u0130</div><div class="example-body"><strong>S\u00fcrekli \u00f6znitelikleri gruplama:</strong> S\u00fcrekli de\u011ferleri ayr\u0131k gruplara d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrmek g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc bir \u00f6znitelik m\u00fchendisli\u011fi tekniğidir. \u00d6rneğin, ya\u015f\u0131 gruplara b\u00f6lmek (\u00e7ocuk, gen\u00e7, yeti\u015fkin, ya\u015fl\u0131) a\u011fa\u00e7 tabanl\u0131 modellere yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur ve do\u011frusal modellerde do\u011frusal olmayan etkileri yakalar. <code>np.digitize(yaslar, bins=[13, 18, 65])</code> ile her de\u011feri bir gruba atay\u0131n, sonra grup indekslerini one-hot kodlay\u0131n.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 6: Temel \u0130statistiksel Test
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">6. Temel \u0130statistiksel Test</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>\u0130statistiksel test</strong> \u015fu soruyu sorar: "Bu sonu\u00e7 tesad\u00fcfen ger\u00e7ekle\u015fmi\u015f olabilir mi?" NumPy do\u011frudan hipotez testi fonksiyonlar\u0131 i\u00e7ermez (bunun i\u00e7in SciPy kullan\u0131n), ancak t\u00fcm yap\u0131 ta\u015flar\u0131n\u0131 sunar: rastgele \u00f6rnekleme, bootstrap yeniden \u00f6rnekleme ve Monte Carlo sim\u00fclasyonu. Bu teknikler model performans\u0131n\u0131 de\u011ferlendirmek ve belirsizli\u011fi tahmin etmek i\u00e7in gereklidir.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Bootstrap</div><div class="card-body">Bir istatisti\u011fin da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 tahmin etmek i\u00e7in yerine koymal\u0131 yeniden \u00f6rnekleme. HER istatistik i\u00e7in \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r \u2014 ortalama, medyan, \u00f6zel metrikler.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">G\u00fcven Aral\u0131\u011f\u0131</div><div class="card-body">Ger\u00e7ek de\u011feri belirli bir olas\u0131l\u0131kla i\u00e7eren aral\u0131k (orn. %95 GA). Bootstrap da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131ndan y\u00fczdeliklerle hesaplan\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Monte Carlo</div><div class="card-body">Olas\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131 veya beklentileri tahmin etmek i\u00e7in rastgele sim\u00fclasyon. Binlerce rastgele senaryo \u00fcretin ve sonu\u00e7lar\u0131 say\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Perm\u00fctasyon Testi</div><div class="card-body">Bo\u015f da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m olu\u015fturmak i\u00e7in etiketleri rastgele kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. G\u00f6zlenen istatisti\u011finizi bu da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mla kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rarak p-de\u011feri elde edin.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nnp.random.<span class="fn">seed</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># --- Bootstrap: Ortalama i\u00e7in g\u00fcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 tahmin et ---</span>\ndata = np.random.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">100</span>, <span class="num">15</span>, size=<span class="num">50</span>)  <span class="cm"># k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck \u00f6rneklem</span>\n\nn_bootstrap = <span class="num">10000</span>\nboot_means = np.<span class="fn">empty</span>(n_bootstrap)\n\n<span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(n_bootstrap):\n    sample = np.random.<span class="fn">choice</span>(data, size=<span class="fn">len</span>(data), replace=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n    boot_means[i] = np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(sample)\n\n<span class="cm"># %95 g\u00fcven aral\u0131\u011f\u0131</span>\nci_alt = np.<span class="fn">percentile</span>(boot_means, <span class="num">2.5</span>)\nci_ust = np.<span class="fn">percentile</span>(boot_means, <span class="num">97.5</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"\u00d6rneklem ortalamas\u0131: {np.mean(data):.2f}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"%95 GA: [{ci_alt:.2f}, {ci_ust:.2f}]"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Bootstrap SE: {np.std(boot_means):.2f}"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Bootstrap \u00d6rnekler \u00c7ek</div><div class="step-detail">Veri k\u00fcmenizden <strong>yerine koyarak</strong> rastgele N de\u011fer \u00f6rnekleyin. Bu, orijinalle ayn\u0131 boyutta yeni bir veri k\u00fcmesi olu\u015fturur, ancak baz\u0131 de\u011ferler tekrarlan\u0131r ve di\u011ferleri eksik kal\u0131r \u2014 pop\u00fclasyondan \u00e7ekmenin de\u011fi\u015fkenli\u011fini taklit eder.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">\u0130statisti\u011fi Hesapla</div><div class="step-detail">\u0130lgili istatisti\u011finizi (ortalama, medyan, do\u011fruluk, F1 skoru vb.) her bootstrap \u00f6rneklemi \u00fczerinde hesaplay\u0131n. Bunu 1.000\u201310.000 kez tekrarlayarak istatisti\u011fin <strong>da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131</strong> olu\u015fturun.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">G\u00fcven Aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \u00c7\u0131kar</div><div class="step-detail">Bootstrap da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 \u00fczerinde <code>np.percentile()</code> kullan\u0131n. %95 GA i\u00e7in 2.5\'inci ve 97.5\'inci y\u00fczdelikleri al\u0131n. Bu size \u015funu s\u00f6yler: "Ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferin bu aral\u0131kta oldu\u011fundan %95 eminiz."</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nnp.random.<span class="fn">seed</span>(<span class="num">0</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># --- Perm\u00fctasyon Testi: Model A, Model B\'den daha m\u0131 iyi? ---</span>\nmodel_a_acc = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">0.82</span>, <span class="num">0.85</span>, <span class="num">0.79</span>, <span class="num">0.88</span>, <span class="num">0.84</span>])  <span class="cm"># 5-katl\u0131 CV</span>\nmodel_b_acc = np.<span class="fn">array</span>([<span class="num">0.78</span>, <span class="num">0.80</span>, <span class="num">0.77</span>, <span class="num">0.83</span>, <span class="num">0.79</span>])\n\ngozlenen_fark = np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(model_a_acc) - np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(model_b_acc)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"G\u00f6zlenen fark: {gozlenen_fark:.4f}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Birle\u015ftir ve etiketleri kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r</span>\nbirlesik = np.<span class="fn">concatenate</span>([model_a_acc, model_b_acc])\nn_perm = <span class="num">10000</span>\nperm_farklar = np.<span class="fn">empty</span>(n_perm)\n\n<span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(n_perm):\n    np.random.<span class="fn">shuffle</span>(birlesik)\n    perm_farklar[i] = np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(birlesik[:<span class="num">5</span>]) - np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(birlesik[<span class="num">5</span>:])\n\n<span class="cm"># p-de\u011feri: g\u00f6zlenen kadar a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 olan perm\u00fctasyonlar\u0131n oran\u0131</span>\np_degeri = np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(perm_farklar >= gozlenen_fark)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"p-de\u011feri: {p_degeri:.4f}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Anlaml\u0131!"</span> <span class="kw">if</span> p_degeri < <span class="num">0.05</span> <span class="kw">else</span> <span class="str">"Anlaml\u0131 de\u011fil"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nnp.random.<span class="fn">seed</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># --- Monte Carlo: Rastgele noktalarla \u03c0 tahmin et ---</span>\nn_nokta = <span class="num">100000</span>\nx = np.random.<span class="fn">uniform</span>(-<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, n_nokta)\ny = np.random.<span class="fn">uniform</span>(-<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, n_nokta)\n\n<span class="cm"># Birim \u00e7emberin i\u00e7indeki noktalar: x\u00b2 + y\u00b2 \u2264 1</span>\nicinde = (x**<span class="num">2</span> + y**<span class="num">2</span>) <= <span class="num">1</span>\npi_tahmin = <span class="num">4</span> * np.<span class="fn">mean</span>(icinde)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Tahmini \u03c0: {pi_tahmin:.4f}"</span>)    <span class="cm"># ~3.1416</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Ger\u00e7ek \u03c0:   {np.pi:.4f}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Hata:      {abs(pi_tahmin - np.pi):.4f}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># --- ML i\u00e7in Monte Carlo: \u00c7apraz do\u011frulama varyans\u0131 ---</span>\ntest_acc = np.random.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">0.85</span>, <span class="num">0.03</span>, size=<span class="num">100</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"\\nOrtalama do\u011fruluk: {np.mean(test_acc):.4f}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Std do\u011fruluk:     {np.std(test_acc):.4f}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"%95 GA: [{np.percentile(test_acc, 2.5):.4f}, "</span>\n      <span class="str">f"{np.percentile(test_acc, 97.5):.4f}]"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Bootstrap Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-boot-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var n=50,nboot=5000,mu=100,sig=15;'
+ 'var data=[];for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var u1=Math.random(),u2=Math.random();data.push(mu+sig*Math.sqrt(-2*Math.log(u1))*Math.cos(2*Math.PI*u2));}'
+ 'var means=[];for(var b=0;b<nboot;b++){var s=0;for(var j=0;j<n;j++){s+=data[Math.floor(Math.random()*n)];}means.push(s/n);}'
+ 'means.sort(function(a,b){return a-b;});'
+ 'var ci_lo=means[Math.floor(0.025*nboot)],ci_hi=means[Math.floor(0.975*nboot)];'
