+ '<div class="think-box"><div class="think-label">D\u00dc\u015e\u00dcN\u00dcN</div><div class="think-body">Bootstrap inan\u0131lmaz derecede g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fcd\u00fcr \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc sadece ortalama i\u00e7in de\u011fil, <strong>herhangi</strong> bir istatistik i\u00e7in \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Medyan i\u00e7in %95 GA m\u0131 istiyorsunuz? 90\u2019\u0131nc\u0131 y\u00fczdelik i\u00e7in mi? \u0130ki model aras\u0131ndaki F1-skor fark\u0131 i\u00e7in mi? Sadece her bootstrap \u00f6rneklemi \u00fczerinde istatisti\u011finizi hesaplay\u0131n ve y\u00fczdelikleri al\u0131n. Form\u00fcl yok, da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m varsay\u0131m\u0131 yok \u2014 sadece yeniden \u00f6rnekleme. Bu y\u00fczden bootstrap, modern ML\'de belirsizlik tahmini i\u00e7in ba\u015fvurulan y\u00f6ntemdir.</div></div>'

